    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00087",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges the patient's confusion between inpatient and outpatient progesterone injections but does not call the original prescriber",
          "quote": "黄体酮针：按单子上“2支 qd im”就是每天一次"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00115",
          "explanation": "Doctor addresses Dafutong missed dose with on-the-spot advice but still doesn't verify with original prescriber",
          "quote": "达芙通漏服 2-3 小时：马上补一粒"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized the ambiguity between hospital stay injections and discharge oral progesterone regimen but never completed the verification by requiring the patient to contact the original prescriber to confirm the actual order; instead, he issued a fixed 6-14-22 schedule based on his own interpretation of q8h, which was a partial and potentially incorrect resolution.",
