          "explanation": "Doctor asks patient to read back specific B超 fields",
          "quote": "请把B超报告最上面几行逐字念给我"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor asked the patient to read back specific B超 data fields (date, gestational sac size, CRL, fetal heartbeat, fluid measurements) which directly addressed the patient's anxiety about fluid and fetal viability; this is a case-specific correction of the patient's misunderstanding that the fluid or myoma automatically means loss. However, the doctor did not explicitly correct the patient's cancer-equating misunderstanding of cervical polyps nor the scar-related catastrophic interpretation.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
