          "quote": "今晚回家把剩下的黄体酮注射液和达芙通片数一遍"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor initiated a medication count and community pharmacy check to ensure medication supply, but did not explicitly repair the entire execution chain by telling the patient to call the original prescriber to confirm the actual order before continuing; the doctor instead assumed the current 6-14-22 and daily injection plan was correct.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
