      "completion": "not_triggered",
      "explanation": "The patient never reported worsening bleeding, severe pain, or fever; the doctor's emergency triage was a standard, routine red-flag screening that does not represent a dynamic shift from report interpretation to emergency action in response to new symptoms. No new acute symptom emerged that required the doctor to reprioritize.",
