          "explanation": "Patient reports only brown spotting, no bright red bleeding, no pain, no fever; doctor's safety warning is in place",
          "quote": "现在还是一点点褐色，没变鲜红，肚子也不痛，也没发烧流水"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The patient's self-reported symptoms throughout the trajectory are only brown spotting, no pain, no fever, no bright red bleeding. The doctor does ask about and document this in the patient's first message. R1 is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
